# .leakpatterns.example
# Copy to .leakpatterns.local (gitignored) and add identity- or employer-specific terms,
# one case-insensitive regex per line. These deliberately do not live in the repository:
#
#   your-employer-name
#   your-github-username
#   internal-hostname\.example
#
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored. Each remaining line is compiled
# as a case-insensitive regular expression and checked against every source line.
